<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Duratex upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Duratex upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said in a report it upgraded Brazilian home building supplies manufacturer Duratex to buy from hold.  </p>
<p>-- It set a year-end target price of $50 in 1997, with upside of 28 percent.</p>
<p>-- &quot;At its current price of $39.2, we believe the discount to the market's 1997 and 1998 P/Es is too high,&quot; it said. ($39.21).</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
</text>
